\section{Notation and standing assumptions}

Everything the expansion uses is restated here. Nothing is assumed from the
paper. Where the paper states a domain, the sentence it comes from is quoted;
where it does not, the table says so, because a step whose symbols have no stated
range cannot be checked and often cannot be justified either.

